Dear Players,

Since the official version launched, we have received a lot of feedback from players. Due to the current fragmentation of the game world, the number of players in some worlds has decreased, leading to a scarcity of items in the Trading Post. To address this issue and enhance your gaming experience, as the Persia DLC is about to be released, we have decided to enable cross-server character transfer. Characters from Classic Era and Lotus Era can be transferred to New Era. The specific rules for character transfer are as follows:

1.Characters created before 00:00 AM, January 3, 2025, UTC Time, are eligible for character transfer.
2.The character transfer operation can only transfer the character's own data, including character level, proficiency, unlocked skills, honor (Nobility), expertise points, comprehension points, skill experience, recipe points, unlocked recipes, civilization level, arts, quests, achievements, copper coins(Each character can transfer up to 5 million), gold tokens, equipped gear, items in the shortcut bar, items in the regular and exquisite box inventories. Data such as guilds, mounts, and warriors cannot be transferred and will clear the data of mounts, warriors, vehicles, and buildings in the subordinates interface;
3.During the character transfer period, we will enable building recycle function for the Classic Era and Lotus Era servers and increase character carrying capacity;
4.After the character transfer application is submitted, it will take effect after the next maintenance. Please prepare the items wanted for the transfer in advance;
5.Please ensure there are no characters in New Era to proceed with the transfer operation. If there are already characters in New Era during the operation period, this transfer application will fail and can be applied again next time;
6.Each account can only transfer once. After the character transfer is successful, no further transfer applications can be made.

Character Transfer Entry: [url=https://servertransfer.mythofempires.com/][Click to Enter][/url]

In the future, we will adjust the servers based on the status of Classic Era and Lotus Era. Players who intend to transfer servers are advised to prepare their items promptly and proceed with the character transfer operation.
